    "notes": [
      {
        "kind": "OWNER_DECISION",
        "section": "—",
        "text": "RDF is the pilot agency and the sandbox target; Nyagatare is the pilot district (owner, 2026-10-25). The playable day stages Nyagatare stadium only."
      },
      {
        "kind": "REHEARSAL_COMPRESSION",
        "section": "§1",
        "text": "Printed: registration 23 May–1 June, Nyagatare sits 6–7 June. Played: registration open now and Nyagatare examining today, so one session can rehearse apply → gate (gate admission is valid only on the exam day, Kigali time)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "POLICY_MODEL_GAP",
        "section": "§1, §9",
        "text": "Each district sits on TWO consecutive days; a session has one exam date, so only day 1 is staged."
      },
      {
        "kind": "POLICY_MODEL_GAP",
        "section": "§1, §9",
        "text": "Reserve age caps are set by qualification; the platform expresses them as three categories chosen by the applicant (18–25 / ≤26 / ≤27). The minimum age for A0/IPRC and specialists is not printed; the platform applies 18."
      },
      {
        "kind": "POLICY_MODEL_GAP",
        "section": "§1",
        "text": "\"Not on the list of persons dismissed from public service\" and \"good conduct\" have no registry check; they rest on documents and officers."
      },
      {
        "kind": "POLICY_MODEL_GAP",
        "section": "§1",
        "text": "The documents list asks for an A-Level certificate for everyone, though regular personnel need only S3; the platform document door derives the certificate from the category."
      }
